<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Makemoney (230)</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>makemoney &lt;amount&gt; &lt;coin&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>makemoney 100 gold
</pre>
<p>Creates coins out of nothing, in your purse: up to 1000 at a time. They 
are added to any coins of that kind you already carry. Leave out the 
coin, or name one that doesn't exist, and you are shown the list of 
coins to choose from (see <a cmd='#'>Help Money</a>).
</p><p>Use it for quests and prizes, not to help players along. It is logged.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Money</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Load</a>
</pre>




</div>